  "description": "**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=829122), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=11435084)\n\nOn the first day of work that she had been looking forward to, new PD Kim Mo Ni was advised to resign by her team leader : \"Pack your bags and get out now! This is a webtoon company founded by gangsters...!\" She thought the company was just serious about teasing new employees, but she couldn't laugh when she saw a coworker carrying a metal pipe to work. Will our Kim Mo Ni be able to survive in a webtoon company full of works and violence ?",
